N.4 From the Compiler to a Static Binary

The final pipeline is:

```
Model description (DSL or ONNX)  
    → BG‑IR  
    → Stencil‑AD  
    → AOP‑RL scheduler (if RL)  
    → TopoMem / Co‑Mem  
    → C code emitter  
    → C compiler (gcc/clang) + CUDA/HIP kernels → binary
```

The emitted C code includes no external dependencies except a minimal set of accelerator API calls. The binary can be deployed bare‑metal, without Python, NCCL, or a dynamic scheduler.

